OL,3,AIsrael heads to polls for pivotal
OL,4,Aelection defined by security and
OL,5,Ademocracy
OL,6,
OL,7,FTurnout in Israel's election is
OL,8,Freportedly at its highest since 1981,
OL,9,Fas Israelis vote in what many view as
OL,10,Fone of the most pivotal elections in
OL,11,Fthe country's history.
OL,13,FPolling published on Friday suggests
OL,14,Fincumbent Benjamin Netanyahu is almost
OL,15,Fneck-and-neck with former military
OL,16,Fchief Gadi Eisenkot in the race to
OL,17,Fbecome prime minister.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
