OL,3,AIsrael heads to polls for pivotal
OL,4,Aelection defined by security and
OL,5,Ademocracy
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut neither of their political blocs
OL,8,Fare projected to win the 61 seats
OL,9,Fneeded to form a majority government -
OL,10,Fmeaning weeks or months of political
OL,11,Fwrangling may lie ahead.
OL,13,FThe campaign has been shaped by the
OL,14,Fissues of democracy and security, and
OL,15,Fthe election is widely being seen as a
OL,16,Freferendum on Netanyahu's rule.
